{"description":"Spike 2 — e2e local-\u003eVPS full lifecycle. BuildRelease local, push via SSH, Install di server, Verify (verification-contract PASS required), Activate, query `anvil status`, Rollback ke release sebelumnya. Kritikal path.","investigationNotes":"AC:\n- AC1: `anvil build` lokal menghasilkan artifact dengan manifest.json (identity from content, version, checksum) valid terhadap spec:artifact-manifest-schema.\n- AC2: Push + `Coordinator.Install(projectID, artifactPath)` di server sukses, Negotiate capability check PASS (deployment model server).\n- AC3: Verification gate (spec:verification-contract) PASS sebelum Activate — Activate ditolak jika verify FAIL (negative test).\n- AC4: Activate sets release active, `anvil status` observable (state before assumptions), Rollback restores previous active release, first-class lifecycle enforced.\n- AC5: Audit trail: who deployed logged di server (SSH user + timestamp).\nTimebox: 5 hari, blocking untuk spike 3. Evidence: e2e script + verify logs + status/rollback output.","conclusion":""}